The independent probe scripts, CAN reference endpoints and test harness are new
work provided under the Apache License 2.0. The reference endpoints do not import
or reuse the Gemstone sender/receiver implementations. The controlled mutation
experiment changes a private copy only; packaged upstream files remain original.

Four proposed serial patches are supplied separately under patches/. They are
validated only in explicitly prepared copies. The 27 vendored upstream files
remain unmodified. Serial tests use independent Linux PTY peers and expected bytes.

SDK verification, AArch64 build-only checks, local/hosted CI gates, delivery tools,
and contribution drafts are community additions. The SDK itself is not bundled.
The five application patches and PR drafts have not been submitted upstream.
Local and hosted CI acceptance are separate from physical board execution.
